{"page": 119, "lines": [{"text": "110 AN EXPOSITION OF ST. PAUL'S Chap. iii.", "words": [["110", -1.0], ["AN", -3.0], ["EXPOSITION", -2.0], ["OF", 3.0], ["ST.", 3.0], ["PAUL'S", -1.0], ["Chap.", 17.0], ["iii.", -2.0]]}, {"text": "and valiant, as endowed with the Spirit of God, covered", "words": [["and", -2.0], ["valiant,", -2.0], ["as", -4.0], ["endowed", -2.0], ["with", -2.0], ["the", -2.0], ["Spirit", -1.0], ["of", 2.0], ["God,", -1.0], ["covered", -2.0]]}, {"text": "with his gifts as arms of defence, and by their means con-", "words": [["with", -2.0], ["his", -1.0], ["gifts", -1.0], ["as", -4.0], ["arms", -3.0], ["of", 2.0], ["defence,", -1.0], ["and", -2.0], ["by", -1.0], ["their", -2.0], ["means", -3.0], ["con-", -3.0]]}, {"text": "querors over all evil.", "words": [["querors", -2.0], ["over", -4.0], ["all", -2.0], ["evil.", -1.0]]}, {"text": "Vers. 18. Forbearing one another, and forgiving one ano-", "words": [["Vers.", -6.0], ["18.", -1.0], ["Forbearing", 13.0], ["one", 11.0], ["another,", 15.0], ["and", 13.0], ["forgiving", 13.0], ["one", 16.0], ["ano-", 12.0]]}, {"text": "ther, if any man have a quarrel against any: even as", "words": [["ther,", 17.0], ["if", 16.0], ["any", 20.0], ["man", 17.0], ["have", 16.0], ["a", 15.0], ["quarrel", 17.0], ["against", 13.0], ["any:", 18.0], ["even", 11.0], ["as", 11.0]]}, {"text": "Christ forgave you, so also do ye.", "words": [["Christ", 15.0], ["forgave", 19.0], ["you,", 20.0], ["so", 11.0], ["also", 18.0], ["do", 16.0], ["ye.", 21.0]]}, {"text": "In these words the Apostle shews the use and requires", "words": [["In", -1.0], ["these", -2.0], ["words", -2.0], ["the", -2.0], ["Apostle", -3.0], ["shews", -2.0], ["the", -2.0], ["use", -3.0], ["and", -2.0], ["requires", -3.0]]}, {"text": "the practice of the afore-mentioned virtues of meekness", "words": [["the", -2.0], ["practice", -3.0], ["of", 2.0], ["the", -2.0], ["afore-mentioned", -2.0], ["virtues", -2.0], ["of", 2.0], ["meekness", -2.0]]}, {"text": "and long-suffer